{
  "title": "Ziyaarat of Imam Ali Naqi (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَبَا الْحَسَنِ عَلِیَّ ابْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ ۨ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAL HASANE A’LIY YABNA MOHAMMADENIZ \nPeace be upon you, O Aba al-Hasan, Ali the son of Muhammad, \nالزَّکِیَّ الرَّاشِدَ النُّوْرَ الثَّاقِبَ \nZAKIYYAR RAASHIDAN NOORAS SAAQEBA \nthe pure, the rightly-guided, the brightly shining light, \nوَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُہٗ \nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nand the mercy of Allah and His blessings\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَفِیَّ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAFIYYAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O chosen one of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا سِرَّ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SIRRAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O confidant of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَبْلَ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HABLAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O rope of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اٰلَ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AALAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O family of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خِیَرَۃَ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHEYARATAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O chosen one of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَفَوَۃَ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAFWATAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O purest choice of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمِیْنَ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEENAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O trustee of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَقَّ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HAQQAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O truth of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَبِیْبَ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HABEEBAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O beloved of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا نُوْرَ الْاَنْوَارِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL ANWAARE \nPeace be upon you, O light of all lights\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا سَلِیْلَ الْاَخْیَارِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SALEELAL AKHYAARE \nPeace be upon you, O descendant of the righteous\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا عُنْصُرَ الْاَطْہَارِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA U’NSORAL ATHAARE \nPeace be upon you, O essence of the purified ones\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حُجَّۃَ الرَّحْمٰنِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAR RAHMAANE \nPeace be upon you, O proof of the All-Merciful\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا رُکْنَ الْاِیْمَانِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA RUKNAL EEMAANE \nPeace be upon you, O pillar of faith\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَوْلَی الْمُؤمِنِیْنَ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAL MO-MENEENA \nPeace be upon you, O master of the believers\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا وَصِیَّ الْاَوْصِیَاءِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WASIYYAL AWSYAAA-E \nPeace be upon you, O executor of the executors\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اِمَامَ الْاَتْقِیَاءِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA EMAAMAL ATQEYAAA-E \nPeace be upon you, O Imam of the god-fearing\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حُجَّۃَ اللهِ عَلَی الْخَلَائِقِ اَجْمَعِیْنَ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE A’LAL KHALAAA-EQE AJMAE’ENA\nPeace be upon you, O proof of Allah upon all creation\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خَلَفَ اَئِمَّۃِ الدِّیْنِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHALAFA A-IMMATID DEENE \nPeace be upon you, O successor of the Imams of the religion\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّہَا النَّقِیُّ الْعَسْكَرِیْ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAN NAQIYYUL A’SKARIYYO \nPeace be upon you, O the Pure One of al-Askar\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا نُوْرَ اللّٰهِ الْمُضِیِّ\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL LAAHIL MOZIYYE\nPeace be upon you, O radiant light of Allah\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ وَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُہٗ\nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU.\nPeace be upon you, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings."
}
